QuestGuidance.Register("es",177,{
[5633]="70018E1E\n1\tDerrota al líder de los intrusos en Fulz-zahar\tLa entrada a Fulz-zahar se encuentra en Gharâf-fehem. Hersir te ha pedido que derrotes al líder de los intrusos en Fulz-zahar\n2\tHabla con Hersir en Gharâf-fehem\tHersir se encuentra en Gharâf-fehem. Deberías regresar con Hersir en Gharâf-fehem, en las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\n",
[5634]="7004E145\n1\tCompleta 'Una hermosa día de feria' (total: 4)\tCada día hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de la Feria Agrícola. ¡Ven y únete a todos y participa en muchas actividades de la Feria de los Granjeros durante cuatro días!\n2\tHabla con Campanula Redondo\tCampanula Redondo desea agradecerle por su continua participación en la Feria Agrícola.\n",
[5635]="7004E146\n1\tCompleta 'Un soleado día de feria' (total: 4)\tCada día hay algo que hacer durante el Festival de la Feria Agrícola. ¡Ven y únete a todos y participa en muchas actividades de la Feria de los Agricultores durante cuatro días!\n2\tHabla con Campanula Redondo\tCampanula Redondo desea agradecerte por tu continua participación en la Feria Agrícola.\n",
[5636]="7004E149\n1\tCompleta 'Un soleado día de feria' (total: 4)\tCada día hay algo que hacer durante la Feria Agrícola. ¡Ven y únete a todos y participa en muchas actividades de la Feria Agrícola durante cuatro días!\n2\tHabla con Campanula Redondo\tCampanula Redondo desea agradecerte por tu continua participación en el Festival de la Feria Agrícola.\n",
[5637]="700375D8\n1\tSpeak with Burnoth and the Riders about Léofdag's heroism at the Battle of the Hornburg\tBurnoth is at the Hornburg. Burnoth wants you to join in the memorial for Léofdag, who fell at the Battle of the Hornburg.\n2\tHabla con Burnoth\tBurnoth is at the Hornburg. You should speak with Burnoth again.\n",
[5638]="70016BA0\n1\tAbre las jaulas (total: 6)\030Derrota a los asesinos de Morroval en Tith-maudhûl (total: 6)\tEl campamento de los morrovals está en Tith-maudhûl, al este del campamento de la Fosa Colmilluda. Bési te pidió que liberaras a los orcos infectados de sus jaulas y derrotaras a cualquier morroval en el campamento que también pudiera estar infectado.\n2\tHabla con Bési en el campamento de la Fosa Colmilluda\tBési está en el campamento de la Fosa Colmilluda, al oeste de Tith-maudhûl. Bési estará encantado de saber que liberaste a los orcos infectados de las jaulas y mataste a cualquier morroval que haya sido infectado.\n",
[5639]="700164CD\n1\tRestaurar las paletas con el ácido (cantidad: según el diario)\030Retira la baba de la pala principal (cantidad: según el diario)\tLa rueda de agua se encuentra en la Gran Rueda, al suroeste de Hulwul-nefekh. Las paletas por encima de la rueda están cubiertas de esporas de hongo y limo. Para que la gran rueda vuelva a funcionar, las paletas deben estar en condiciones de funcionar.\n2\tHabla con Ansurr en Hulwul-nefekh\tAnsurr se encuentra en Hulwul-nefekh, al noreste de la Gran Rueda. Ansurr estará encantado de saber que has logrado erradicar el hongo y el limo, y que la rueda está lista para volver a funcionar.\n",
[5640]="70016B27\n1\tHabla con Tyki en el Refugio Sombrío\tTyki se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, en las Fundaciones de Piedra, lejos al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Káti cree que su amigo Tyki, en el Refugio Sombrío, podría saber más sobre el hongo.\n",
[5641]="7005A41C\n1\tRecoge pieles de lobo (total: 8)\030Recoge pelajes de oso (total: 8)\030Recoge pieles de huargo (total: 8)\tBears, Wargs, and wolves can be found throughout the woods of Azanulbizar. Aboki has tasked you with collecting animal pelts to help keep the army warm.\n2\tTalk to Aboki\tAboki is in Amdân. You should bring the furs to Aboki.\n",
[5642]="7001F3C1\n1\tEncuentra los estandartes enrollados (total: 10)\tLos estandartes se encuentran entre las ruinas y los valles al noreste del campamento de Dale. Dale Vadosalvia permanece en su campamento cerca del puente sobre el Paso de Moscagua. Debes volver con él cuando hayas conseguido los estandartes de las ruinas del noreste, tal y como te pidió.\n2\tLleva los estandartes enrollados a Dale Vadosalvia\tDale Vadosalvia se encuentra en el campamento de cazadores, al suroeste de donde encontraste los estandartes. Debes regresar con Dale con los estandartes orcos enrollados.\n",
[5643]="70058671\n1\tFind the dwarf-scout Borghild\tScout Borghild is somewhere in north-west Elderslade. Gunvald has asked you to bring orders to Borghild and lend what support you may.\n",
[5644]="7000B0FC\n1\tSpeak with Gelbes at Glân Vraig and complete a patrol through the Ettenmoors as a Ranger (Cost: 500 Commendations)\tGelbes is at Glân Vraig in the Ettenmoors. Speak with her to call a ranger to the Ettenmoors. The Rangers will assist in retaking Lugazag, but they request that you take the place of a Ranger in Eriador while they come to the Ettenmoors to fight in your stead. You should speak with Gelbes.\n2\tTalk to Gelbes\tGelbes is at Glân Vraig. A Ranger came to the Ettenmoors in your stead and fought valiantly, while you patrolled Eriador in their stead.\n",
[5645]="70000193\n1\tHabla con Fimreg\tFimreg está en Gath Forthnír, al norte y al este de Valleoscuro. Thorod te ha pedido que hables con Fimreg en Gath Forthnír. Está preocupado por lo que ha descubierto, pero no quiere decir por qué.\n2\tBusca en Urugarth a la criatura que está envenenando el agua\tUrugarth está al oeste de Gath Forthnír y al norte de Imlad Balchorth. Fimreg cree que alguna criatura de gran tamaño está envenenando las aguas. Si tal bestia existe, se encontrará prueba de ello río arriba, en Urugarth.\n3\tLleva el garfio óseo a Fimreg\tFimreg está en Gath Forthnír, en el este de Himbar, al este de Urugarth. Has encontrado un curioso garfio óseo, como una garra o pico, pero que no se parece a ninguna parte de animal que hayas visto antes.\n",
[5646]="700494C3\n1\tDefeat foes at Fushaum Bal South (total: 6)\tFushaum Bal is located in Talath Úrui. You should defeat those who dwell at Fushaum Bal South.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated many foes at Fushaum Bal South.\n",
[5647]="70049422\n1\tDestroy tents at Fushaum Bal south (total: 8)\tFushaum Bal is located in Talath Úrui. You should destroy tents in Fushaum Bal south.\n2\tCompletado\tDestroyed many tents at Fushaum Bal South.\n",
[5648]="700494C7\n1\tCollect tribute from those in Fushaum Bal North (total: 6)\tYou should collect tribute from those in Fushaum Bal North.\n2\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5649]="700494C9\n1\tChallenge those who oppose Khirgi\tA good place to challenge opposers can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should challenge those that would oppose Khirgi.\n2\tHold your ground and defeat the rowdy Haradrim\tYou should hold your ground! Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n3\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5650]="700494B3\n1\tDefeat Mâlatuk's raiders (total: 2)\030Defeat Thâng's raiders (total: 2)\tThâng and Mâlatuk's raiders can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should defeat Thâng and Mâlatuk's raiders while avoiding the guards. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5651]="700494B6\n1\tSteal supplies from Fushaum Bal South (total: 8)\tSupplies can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should steal supplies from Fushaum Bal South while avoiding the guards. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5652]="700494C4\n1\tDefeat Shatúrro, the Spear\tShatúrro can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should defeat Shatúrro.\n2\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5653]="700494BA\n1\tDefeat Shatúrro's hunters (total: 4)\tShatúrro's hunters can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should defeat any hunters under the command of Shatúrro.\n2\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5654]="700494C0\n1\tCollect sûlok feed from the feed bag\tA feed bag can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should collect sûlok feed from the feed bag.\n2\tSûlokil can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should feed the sûlokil.\t\n3\tTalk to Khirgi\tKhirgi can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to Khirgi.\n",
[5655]="7004BEAB\n1\tDefeat Mâlatuk's raiders (total: 2)\030Defeat Thâng's raiders (total: 2)\tRaiders can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should defeat raiders while avoiding the guards. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tTalk to the Khundolar Commander\tThe Khundolar Commander can be found at Fushaum Bal North. You should talk to the Khundolar Commander.\n",
[5656]="7004942A\n1\tCollect stew from the cooking pot\tThe cooking pot can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should collect stew from the cooking pot.\n2\tNurnhoth slaves can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should give some stew to the Nurnhoth.\t\n3\tTalk to Thâng\tThâng can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Thâng.\n",
[5657]="70049428\n1\tDefeat foes at Fushaum Bal North (total: 6)\tFushaum Bal North is located in Talath Úrui. You should defeat those who dwell at Fushaum Bal North.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated many foes at Fushaum Bal North.\n",
[5658]="700494B7\n1\tSteal food from Fushaum Bal North (total: 6)\tFood can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should steal food from Fushaum Bal North while avoiding the guards. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tTalk to Thâng\tThâng can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Thâng.\n",
[5659]="700494BE\n1\tDestroy watch-towers at Fushaum Bal North (total: 6)\tFushaum Bal is located in Talath Úrui. You should destroy watch-towers in Fushaum Bal North.\n2\tCompletado\tDestroyed many watch-towers at Fushaum Bal North.\n",
[5660]="700494C8\n1\tDefeat Khirgi's Bridge Guards (total: 4)\tKhirgi's Bridge Guards can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should defeat the men guarding the bridge to Fushaum Bal North.\n2\tTalk to Mâlatuk\tMâlatuk can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Mâlatuk.\n",
[5661]="700494C6\n1\tDefeat Khirgi's loyal (total: 4)\tKhirgi's loyal can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should defeat Khirgi's loyal while avoiding the guards. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tTalk to Mâlatuk\tMâlatuk can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Mâlatuk.\n",
[5662]="700494C5\n1\tDefeat Khirgi's Scouts (total: 4)\tKhirgi's Scouts can be found around Fushaum Bal. You should defeat any men scouting around Fushaum Bal.\n2\tTalk to Mâlatuk\tMâlatuk can be found at Fushaum Bal. You should talk to Mâlatuk.\n",
[5663]="700494C2\n1\tCount bandit stash (total: 8)\tThe Haradrim bandit chief's stash can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should count the stash for Thâng to make sure it is all there.\n2\tTalk to Thâng\tThâng can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Thâng.\n",
[5664]="700494B9\n1\tYou should bribe the poor in Fushaum Bal North.\t\n2\tTalk to Thâng\tThâng can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Thâng.\n",
})
